Discover existing organization accounts and inventory sources (requires aws feature)

Usage: aws-inventory discover [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>      
      --region <REGION>        [default: us-east-1]
      --organization           
      --hierarchy              
      --config-aggregators     
      --resource-explorer      
      --max-pages <MAX_PAGES>  [default: 10000]
      --page-size <PAGE_SIZE>  [default: 100]
  -h, --help                   Print help
